              "body": "I propose to modify the requirements as follows (to align with the rest of the sections):\n\n### Additional Protocol Requirements\n\n| REQ-ID   | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| B3-AA-1  | The protocol is required to maintain a clear separation between the identity of the requesting agent and the identity of the sub-agent or tool being invoked. Authorization decisions are required to be made with respect to the requesting agent's identity to prevent privilege escalation. |\n| B3-AA-2  | Error responses are required to include a machine-readable error code, a human-readable description, and an indication of whether the error is transient or permanent. The protocol is recommended to define a standard taxonomy of error codes applicable across agent and tool invocations. |",
